    CallNextHookEx
    ChangeClipboardChain
    CheckDlgButton
    CheckMenuItem
    CheckRadioButton
    CloseClipboard
    CopyAcceleratorTableW
    CreateAcceleratorTableW
    CreateCaret
    CreateMenu
    CreatePopupMenu
    DestroyAcceleratorTable
